DESCRIPTION:This week-long workshop is designed to take teens' robotics sk
 ills to the next level by delving into the advanced capabilities of the LE
 GO Mindstorms EV3 platform. Participants will engage in challenging projec
 ts that emphasize complex programming\, sophisticated sensor integration\,
  and innovative design principles. Through hands-on experimentation and cr
 eative problem-solving\, students will gain the knowledge and confidence t
 o tackle real-world robotics challenges with ingenuity and skill. This wor
 kshop is run by ICE Robotics.
